IMPORT prelude
DECLARE P HAS
    `mínimo` IS A NUMBER
    `máximo` IS A NUMBER
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
a `excede` b MEANS a GREATER THAN b

GIVEN q IS A NUMBER
      pc IS A P
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`dentro` q pc MEANS
        NOT (pc's `mínimo` `excede` q)
    AND NOT (q `excede` pc's `máximo`)
